OL,3,ASpeed camera fault may have allowed
OL,4,Adrivers to escape fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office has revoked the
OL,7,Fapproval that allows the footage to be
OL,8,Fused as evidence in legal proceedings.
OL,9,FUS firm Verra Mobility operates the
OL,10,Fcameras but National Highways said it
OL,11,Fwould now end its contract with the
OL,12,Fcompany.
OL,14,FRoads minister Justin Madders told the
OL,15,FBBC: "We can't take chances with this.
